      "folder": "c1d2e3f4-0001-4000-c000-000000000001",
      "postType": "a1b2c3d4-0001-4000-a000-000000000001",
      "fields": {
        "TITLE": "About Viglet",
        "SUBTITLE": "Our mission is to simplify content management",
        "HERO_IMAGE": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?w=1200&h=600&fit=crop",
        "BODY": "<p>Founded with a vision to democratize content management, Viglet brings enterprise-grade CMS capabilities to teams of all sizes. Our open-source platform is built on modern technologies like Spring Boot and React.</p><p>We believe that content management should be accessible, flexible, and enjoyable. That's why we built the Universal Editor — an inline editing experience that puts content authors in control.</p>",
        "CTA_TEXT": "View Services",
        "CTA_URL": "/services"
      }
    },
